  <div class="sec-label"><div class="sec-label-num">1</div><div class="sec-label-text">The Multidisciplinary Team</div><div class="sec-label-bar"></div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="mdt-map"><div class="mdt-ring"><div class="mdt-discipline" style="background:#059669;">Exercise Physiology</div><div class="mdt-discipline" style="background:#3B82F6;">Physiotherapy</div><div class="mdt-discipline" style="background:#8B5CF6;">Psychology</div></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:0 20px;"><div class="mdt-center-node">🧑‍⚕️<br>OT +<br>Participant</div></div><div class="mdt-ring"><div class="mdt-discipline" style="background:#F59E0B;">Positive Behaviour Support</div><div class="mdt-discipline" style="background:#EF4444;">Speech Pathology</div><div class="mdt-discipline" style="background:#6366F1;">Dietetics</div></div></div><div class="callout teal" style="margin-top:8px;"><div class="callout-icon">🤝</div><div class="callout-content"><strong>No single discipline can address all factors.</strong> Effective collaboration requires clear communication, aligned goals, and awareness of each discipline's role.</div></div></div>
  <div class="sec-label"><div class="sec-label-num">2</div><div class="sec-label-text">Referral Flags by Discipline</div><div class="sec-label-bar"></div></div>
  <table class="barrier-table"><thead><tr><th class="barrier-col" style="background:#E4F2EF;color:var(--green);">If You Notice...</th><th class="solution-col" style="background:#EEF2FF;color:#4F46E5;">Consider Referring To...</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="b">Reduced physical capacity, fatigue, low endurance</td><td>Exercise Physiology or Physiotherapy</td></tr><tr><td class="b">Emotional distress, low motivation, or behavioural challenges</td><td>Psychology or Positive Behaviour Support</td></tr><tr><td class="b">Communication difficulties affecting engagement</td><td>Speech Pathology</td></tr><tr><td class="b">Nutritional concerns impacting health or function</td><td>Dietetics</td></tr></tbody></table>
  <div class="sec-label"><div class="sec-label-num">3</div><div class="sec-label-text">SMART Goal Setting</div><div class="sec-label-bar"></div></div>
  <div class="smart-grid"><div class="smart-tile"><div class="smart-letter" style="color:var(--green);">S</div><div class="smart-word" style="color:var(--green);">Specific</div><div class="smart-desc">Clearly describes what the participant will achieve</div></div><div class="smart-tile"><div class="smart-letter" style="color:#3B82F6;">M</div><div class="smart-word" style="color:#3B82F6;">Measurable</div><div class="smart-desc">Progress can be tracked and outcomes verified</div></div><div class="smart-tile"><div class="smart-letter" style="color:#F59E0B;">A</div><div class="smart-word" style="color:#F59E0B;">Achievable</div><div class="smart-desc">Realistic within the participant's capacity</div></div><div class="smart-tile"><div class="smart-letter" style="color:#EF4444;">R</div><div class="smart-word" style="color:#EF4444;">Relevant</div><div class="smart-desc">Meaningful and important to the participant</div></div><div class="smart-tile"><div class="smart-letter" style="color:#8B5CF6;">T</div><div class="smart-word" style="color:#8B5CF6;">Time-bound</div><div class="smart-desc">Has a defined timeframe for achievement</div></div></div>
  <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="callout navy"><div class="callout-icon">❌</div><div class="callout-content"><strong>Instead of:</strong> "Improve independence at home"</div></div><div class="callout teal"><div class="callout-icon">✅</div><div class="callout-content"><strong>Use:</strong> "Prepare a simple meal independently 3 times/week within 4 weeks"</div></div></div>
  <div class="sec-label"><div class="sec-label-num">4</div><div class="sec-label-text">Working Backwards from the Ideal Outcome</div><div class="sec-label-bar"></div></div>
  <div class="grid-2" style="align-items:start;"><div class="card"><div class="wb-flow"><div class="wb-row ideal"><div class="wb-icon">🏆</div>IDEAL OUTCOME — What would full success look like?</div><div class="wb-connector"></div><div class="wb-row steps"><div class="wb-icon">🪜</div>KEY STEPS — What needs to happen to get there?</div><div class="wb-connector"></div><div class="wb-row current"><div class="wb-icon">📍</div>CURRENT BASELINE — Where is the participant now?</div></div><div class="callout teal" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="callout-icon">💡</div><div class="callout-content">This ensures therapy is always aligned with <strong>meaningful outcomes</strong>, not isolated tasks.</div></div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-title"><div class="card-icon">🪜</div>Action Planning Steps</div><div class="card-body"><ol style="padding-left:18px;"><li style="padding:4px 0;">Define the ideal outcome clearly with the participant</li><li style="padding:4px 0;">Break the outcome into smaller, concrete steps</li><li style="padding:4px 0;">Identify the participant's current baseline honestly</li><li style="padding:4px 0;">Determine the next single achievable step</li><li style="padding:4px 0;">Implement, review, and adjust as needed</li></ol></div></div></div>
  <div class="sec-label"><div class="sec-label-num">5</div><div class="sec-label-text">Barrier → Solution Map</div><div class="sec-label-bar"></div></div>
  <table class="barrier-table"><thead><tr><th class="barrier-col">⚠️ Barrier</th><th class="solution-col">✅ Solution / Strategy</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="b">Fatigue limiting task completion</td><td>Reduce task duration or break into smaller components</td></tr><tr><td class="b">Low motivation or confidence</td><td>Link task to meaningful goals; celebrate small wins; use MI</td></tr><tr><td class="b">Environmental limitations at home</td><td>Modify environment or introduce AT or HM pathway</td></tr><tr><td class="b">Limited support network</td><td>Explore NDIS support options; involve MDT; build peer connections</td></tr><tr><td class="b">Physical limitations (strength, mobility)</td><td>Refer to Exercise Physiology or Physiotherapy</td></tr></tbody></table>
  <div class="sec-label"><div class="sec-label-num">6</div><div class="sec-label-text">Case-Based Discussion</div><div class="sec-label-bar"></div></div>
  <div class="case-card" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
    <div class="case-header"><div class="case-badge">Case 1</div><div class="case-title">Chris — "I Just Want My Life Back"</div></div>
    <div class="case-body">
      <div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:var(--green-pale);color:var(--green);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:12px;margin:2px 3px 2px 0;">Age: <span style="font-weight:400;">45</span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:var(--green-pale);color:var(--green);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:12px;margin:2px 3px 2px 0;">Presentation: <span style="font-weight:400;">Post-cancer, fatigue + deconditioning</span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:var(--green-pale);color:var(--green);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:12px;margin:2px 3px 2px 0;">Workshop Focus: <span style="font-weight:400;">SMART goals · Backward planning · MDT</span></span></div>
      <p class="case-scenario">Chris is a 45-year-old man referred following cancer treatment experiencing significant fatigue, low mood, poor routine, and physical deconditioning. He has withdrawn socially and stopped working. He says "I just want my life back" but can't articulate specific goals. He is linked with OT, EP, and psychology, but communication between clinicians has been limited and there is no shared care plan.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin:16px 0;"><div style="background:#FEF2F2;border:1px solid #FCA5A5;border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:14px;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">⚠️ Key Challenges</div><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;"><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Goal too vague: "life back" = where to start?</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Three clinicians, no shared plan</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Low mood may be primary barrier before physical rehab</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Deconditioning compounded by withdrawal</li></ul></div><div style="background:#EFF6FF;border:1px solid #BFCBFE;border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:14px;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">🤝 MDT Coordination</div><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;"><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Shared goal-setting meeting needed</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Sequence: mood first, then activity</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">OT role: routine, ADLs, occupation-based goals</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">EP: physical capacity; Psychology: mood, identity</li></ul></div><div style="background:var(--gold-pale);border:1px solid #E8C070;border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:14px;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">🎯 Goal Setting</div><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;"><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Work backwards from "life back" to specifics</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Break ideal outcome into stepping stones</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">1 meaningful short-term goal for early momentum</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">SMART framework for each goal</li></ul></div></div>
      
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 280px;gap:16px;margin-top:16px;">
      <div style="background:var(--green-xpale);border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:18px 20px;">
        <div style="font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:12px;">Discussion Questions</div>
        <ol style="padding-left:18px;"><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">"I want my life back" — what questions help identify what this means specifically?</li><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">What would an ideal outcome look like in 12 months?</li><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">Which barriers should be addressed first?</li><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">How should the MDT coordinate — and what risks exist without a shared plan?</li><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">Write a SMART goal for Chris based on one specific area of his life.</li><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">What would the first two sessions focus on?</li></ol>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="background:var(--navy);border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:14px;margin-bottom:10px;">
          <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px;">Facilitator Focus</div>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px;"><span style="background:var(--navy);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-size:10.5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:10px;margin:2px;">SMART goals</span><span style="background:var(--navy);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-size:10.5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:10px;margin:2px;">Backward planning</span><span style="background:var(--navy);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-size:10.5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:10px;margin:2px;">MDT sequencing</span><span style="background:var(--navy);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-size:10.5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:10px;margin:2px;">Realistic pacing</span></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--gold-pale);border:1px solid #E8C070;border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:14px;">
          <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7A5010;margin-bottom:8px;">💡 Facilitator Insight</div>
          <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;"><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">→ "I want my life back" is a direction, not a goal — the clinician's job is to translate it into something actionable.</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">→ Without a shared MDT plan, contradictory messages will undermine Chris's confidence.</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">→ Low mood is likely the primary barrier — sequencing matters.</li></ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div><div class="case-card" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
    <div class="case-header"><div class="case-badge">Case 2</div><div class="case-title">Jessica — The Unrealistic Goal</div></div>
    <div class="case-body">
      <div style="margin-bottom:12px;"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:var(--green-pale);color:var(--green);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:12px;margin:2px 3px 2px 0;">Age: <span style="font-weight:400;">26</span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:var(--green-pale);color:var(--green);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:12px;margin:2px 3px 2px 0;">Diagnosis: <span style="font-weight:400;">FND · Severe anxiety</span></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:var(--green-pale);color:var(--green);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:12px;margin:2px 3px 2px 0;">Workshop Focus: <span style="font-weight:400;">Goal reframing · Graduated action · Family dynamics</span></span></div>
      <p class="case-scenario">Jessica is a 26-year-old with functional neurological disorder and severe anxiety. She rarely leaves home, has inconsistent sleep, avoids appointments, and relies heavily on her parents. In her initial session she states she wants full independence, full-time employment, and to move out — within three months. Her parents are present, highly protective, and inconsistent. Jessica becomes upset when asked to consider what might get in the way.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin:16px 0;"><div style="background:#FEF2F2;border:1px solid #FCA5A5;border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:14px;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">⚠️ Goal &amp; Barrier Analysis</div><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;"><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Goals are extremely ambitious relative to baseline</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Timeline (3 months) is unrealistic</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Emotional dysregulation when goals are challenged</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Parents oscillate between over-protection and high expectations</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Current barriers unaddressed: sleep, avoidance, anxiety</li></ul></div><div style="background:#EFF6FF;border:1px solid #BFCBFE;border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:14px;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">👨‍👩‍👧 Family Dynamics</div><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;"><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Overprotection reinforces dependency and avoidance</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Inconsistent expectations create confusion</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Family may need separate support or MDT involvement</li></ul></div><div style="background:var(--gold-pale);border:1px solid #E8C070;border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:14px;"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:0.07em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">🗓️ Graduated Plan</div><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;"><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Start with baseline: what can Jessica do consistently now?</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">First goal: one outing per week independently</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Psychology for anxiety + emotional regulation first</li><li style="padding:2px 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--body);">Small steps toward the larger vision</li></ul></div></div>
      
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 280px;gap:16px;margin-top:16px;">
      <div style="background:var(--green-xpale);border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:18px 20px;">
        <div style="font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:12px;">Discussion Questions</div>
        <ol style="padding-left:18px;"><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">How would you sensitively reframe Jessica's goals without dismissing her ambition?</li><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">What barriers need to be addressed before independence is realistic?</li><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">How do you set goals that are both meaningful AND achievable?</li><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">How are the parents' behaviours contributing to Jessica's difficulties?</li><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">What would a graduated 3-month action plan look like?</li><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">What MDT involvement would you recommend?</li><li style="padding:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--body);line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">How do you manage Jessica's emotional response to barriers being identified?</li></ol>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="background:var(--navy);border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:14px;margin-bottom:10px;">
          <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px;">Facilitator Focus</div>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px;"><span style="background:var(--navy);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-size:10.5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:10px;margin:2px;">Realistic goal progression</span><span style="background:var(--navy);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-size:10.5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:10px;margin:2px;">Protective family dynamics</span><span style="background:var(--navy);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-size:10.5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:10px;margin:2px;">Emotional regulation</span><span style="background:var(--navy);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-size:10.5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:10px;margin:2px;">Pacing</span><span style="background:var(--navy);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-size:10.5px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:10px;margin:2px;">Graduated planning</span></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--gold-pale);border:1px solid #E8C070;border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:14px;">
          <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7A5010;margin-bottom:8px;">💡 Facilitator Insight</div>
